WEBVTT

00:00:03.172 --> 00:00:08.381
Add each number customers call under Omnichannel Addresses, with Voice calls ticked.

00:00:08.381 --> 00:00:11.332
These are the numbers the entry points route.

00:00:11.801 --> 00:00:16.612
Create a business hours calendar with your weekly hours and holidays.

00:00:16.612 --> 00:00:21.423
A queue or an entry point that uses it is closed outside those hours.

00:00:21.423 --> 00:00:24.501
A disabled calendar never closes anything.

